   "type": "paragraph",
   "html": "Bank Melli Iran” is one of the first banks opened in the republic and it offers a wide range of services to customers in the banking market of Azerbaijan for 25 years. Our bank is insured against all financial risks as a Branch Office of the State Bank of the Islamic Republic of Iran."
  },
  {
   "type": "paragraph",
   "html": "<strong>Funds can be deposited in 6 month periods provided that minimum amount is not less than 5.000 AZN.</strong>"
  },
